commit 84e7428d30c8ee4799e8aa2a88eb7f4160bad76b

C03: a located channel whose observed name contains «?»/«!» (Cotele!!!??) and the finding's trailing join question are not the assistant asking an unsolicited question, so the verified locate answer is no longer vetoed as extra_claim (DISCORD1839 composer fix)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


